flowchart LR
  subgraph A[Agreement state — acceptance is explicit]
    direction TB
    A0((Start)) --> A1[Awaiting client response]
    A1 -->|client accepts v1| A2[Accepted current version]
    A1 -->|client rejects v1| A3[Needs revision]
    A3 -->|provider revises and resends| A1
    A2 -->|either party proposes a change| A4[Change pending]
    A4 -->|other party rejects| A2
    A4 -->|other party asks clarification| A2
    A4 -->|other party explicitly accepts| A5[New version becomes current]
    A5 -->|later change proposed| A4
  end

  subgraph P[Payment state — independent from agreement]
    direction TB
    P0((Start)) --> P1[Not started]
    P1 -->|client starts checkout| P2[Creating Sandbox order]
    P2 -->|server stores order ID| P3[Created]
    P2 -->|timeout or uncertain result| P6[Unknown; reconcile]
    P3 -->|buyer approves; server capture| P4[Capturing]
    P3 -->|buyer cancels| P3
    P4 -->|completed and exact amount/currency match| P5[Captured to Sandbox merchant]
    P4 -->|timeout or mismatch| P6
    P6 -->|reconcile before safe retry| P4
  end

  Separation[Agreement acceptance does not capture payment<br/>Payment capture does not prove delivery or quality]
  A5 -. no automatic payment transition .-> Separation
  P5 -. no automatic fulfilment transition .-> Separation

  classDef pending fill:#fff5e6,stroke:#c88c4e,color:#634721
  classDef accepted fill:#edf8f1,stroke:#63896c,color:#173d34
  classDef terminal fill:#eef4ff,stroke:#5574a4,color:#223653
  class A1,A4,A3,P2,P4,P6 pending
  class A2,A5 accepted
  class P3,P5 terminal
